   "words": 1302,
   "body": [
    {
     "t": "h3",
     "a": {
      "id": "introduction"
     },
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "Introduction"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Why:"
         ]
        },
        " Empowering role owners to manage their own roles reduces the administrative burden on the core IAM team. By delegating this responsibility, business owners can maintain their roles efficiently and securely without needing backend access."
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Problem:"
         ]
        },
        " Out-of-the-box, Identity Security Cloud (ISC) requires an administrator to modify role configurations, such as adding or removing entitlements, updating descriptions, or changing owners."
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Goal:"
         ]
        },
        " A custom form and workflow solution that allows role owners to seamlessly manage their assigned roles directly through an interactive launcher."
       ]
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "blockquote",
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "p",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "CAUTION!"
         ]
        },
        {
         "t": "br"
        },
        "\n",
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Important Security Warning:"
         ]
        },
        " This form and workflow solution can make role and access-related changes. Please ensure you read the Safety and Governance Guardrails section below to understand the recommended security measures before deploying this solution."
       ]
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "h3",
     "a": {
      "id": "solution-overview"
     },
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "Solution Overview"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Tech Stack:"
         ]
        },
        " 2 Forms + 3 Workflows"
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "High-Level Flow:"
         ]
        },
        " The solution uses two interactive forms. The first form allows the user to select a role they own. The second form displays the role’s current details and presents the available management actions. Based on the selected action, the backend workflows execute the necessary API calls to modify the role."
       ]
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "c": [
      "The available actions in this solution include the following API calls (all utilizing ",
      {
       "t": "code",
       "c": [
        "PATCH /roles/v1/{roleid}"
       ]
      },
      "):"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Modify Name"
         ]
        },
        "\n",
        {
         "t": "ul",
         "c": [
          "\n",
          {
           "t": "li",
           "c": [
            "Body: ",
            {
             "t": "code",
             "c": [
              "[{\"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/name\", \"value\": \"{{newName}}\"}]"
             ]
            }
           ]
          },
          "\n"
         ]
        },
        "\n"
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Modify Description"
         ]
        },
        "\n",
        {
         "t": "ul",
         "c": [
          "\n",
          {
           "t": "li",
           "c": [
            "Body: ",
            {
             "t": "code",
             "c": [
              "[{\"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/description\", \"value\": \"{{newDescription}}\"}]"
             ]
            }
           ]
          },
          "\n"
         ]
        },
        "\n"
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Modify Requestable Status"
         ]
        },
        "\n",
        {
         "t": "ul",
         "c": [
          "\n",
          {
           "t": "li",
           "c": [
            "Body: ",
            {
             "t": "code",
             "c": [
              "[{\"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/requestable\", \"value\": {{true/false}}}]"
             ]
            }
           ]
          },
          "\n"
         ]
        },
        "\n"
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Change Primary Owner"
         ]
        },
        "\n",
        {
         "t": "ul",
         "c": [
          "\n",
          {
           "t": "li",
           "c": [
            "Body: ",
            {
             "t": "code",
             "c": [
              "[{\"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"/owner\", \"value\": {\"type\": \"IDENTITY\", \"id\": \"{{newOwnerId}}\"}}]"
             ]
            }
           ]
          },
          "\n"
         ]
        },
        "\n"
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Add Entitlement"
         ]
        },
        "\n",
        {
         "t": "ul",
         "c": [
          "\n",
          {
           "t": "li",
           "c": [
            "Body: ",
            {
             "t": "code",
             "c": [
              "[{\"op\": \"add\", \"path\": \"/entitlements/-\", \"value\": {\"id\": \"{{entitlementId}}\", \"type\": \"ENTITLEMENT\"}}]"
             ]
            }
           ]
          },
          "\n"
         ]
        },
        "\n"
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Remove Entitlement"
         ]
        },
        "\n",
        {
         "t": "ul",
         "c": [
          "\n",
          {
           "t": "li",
           "c": [
            "Body: ",
            {
             "t": "code",
             "c": [
              "[{\"op\": \"remove\", \"path\": \"/entitlements/{{index}}\"}]"
             ]
            }
           ]
          },
          "\n"
         ]
        },
        "\n"
       ]
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "h3",
     "a": {
      "id": "user-interface"
     },
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "User Interface"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "c": [
      "The user experience is split into two distinct forms to ensure clarity and provide dynamic context."
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "h4",
     "a": {
      "id": "h-1-role-selector-form"
     },
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "1. Role Selector Form"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "c": [
      "The first step is selecting the role to manage."
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Implementation Details:"
         ]
        },
        " This form utilizes an advanced search and form input filter on the owner UID to display only the roles available to the current user. In the main role management workflow, we use ",
        {
         "t": "code",
         "c": [
          "trigger.launchedby.id"
         ]
        },
        " to retrieve this ID and pass it to the form."
       ]
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "div",
     "a": {
      "class": "d-wrap",
      "data-wrap": "center"
     },
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "lightbox",
       "a": {
        "full": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/original/3X/b/c/bc298e7111e2abdfaedbcf35054838d918ef7c15.png",
        "src": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/original/3X/b/c/bc298e7111e2abdfaedbcf35054838d918ef7c15.png",
        "alt": "Sample_Execution_Select_Role_Form",
        "width": "690",
        "height": "443"
       }
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "Form Code:"
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "br"
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "a",
       "a": {
        "class": "attachment",
        "href": "https://developer.sailpoint.com/discuss/uploads/short-url/zrOVBCb7P9gNiHiEwfT71r2JSq3.json"
       },
       "c": [
        "RoleSelectorForm_cleansed.json"
       ]
      },
      " (2.4 KB)"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "h4",
     "a": {
      "id": "h-2-role-management-form"
     },
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "2. Role Management Form"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "c": [
      "Once a role is selected, the second form displays the role’s current state and available actions."
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Dynamic Summary:"
         ]
        },
        " We use a form input to pull a summary from a ",
        {
         "t": "code",
         "c": [
          "roles/v1/"
         ]
        },
        " HTTP call, displaying all relevant details to the user. A “Define Variable” step maps this data and sets the relevant CSS/HTML tags for a clean display."
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Conditional Fields:"
         ]
        },
        " The form employs heavy conditional logic. When the user selects an action from the “Select Field to Modify” dropdown, the form dynamically adjusts which input fields are visible."
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Smart Entitlement Selection:"
         ]
        },
        " For the “Remove Entitlement” action, the form uses the entitlements field from the ",
        {
         "t": "code",
         "c": [
          "roles/v1/"
         ]
        },
        " API call as an input. This ensures the user can only select entitlements that are actually assigned to the role, preventing errors."
       ]
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "div",
     "a": {
      "class": "d-wrap",
      "data-wrap": "center"
     },
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "lightbox",
       "a": {
        "full": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/original/3X/2/1/2114500073cefbd84721d71a9424da19f504a587.png",
        "src": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/optimized/3X/2/1/2114500073cefbd84721d71a9424da19f504a587_2_394x500.png",
        "srcSet": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/optimized/3X/2/1/2114500073cefbd84721d71a9424da19f504a587_2_394x500.png, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/optimized/3X/2/1/2114500073cefbd84721d71a9424da19f504a587_2_591x750.png 1.5x, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/original/3X/2/1/2114500073cefbd84721d71a9424da19f504a587.png 2x",
        "alt": "Sample_Execution_Modify_Role_Form",
        "width": "394",
        "height": "500"
       }
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "Form Code:"
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "br"
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "a",
       "a": {
        "class": "attachment",
        "href": "https://developer.sailpoint.com/discuss/uploads/short-url/aDBrwAGvWgQ5JBBCFQS4EJvj9Xn.json"
       },
       "c": [
        "RoleManagementForm_cleansed.json"
       ]
      },
      " (11.4 KB)"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "h3",
     "a": {
      "id": "back-end"
     },
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "Back End"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "c": [
      "The backend consists of three workflows to handle the logic. The primary workflow manages standard modifications, while two external trigger workflows handle the complexities of adding and removing entitlements."
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "h4",
     "a": {
      "id": "h-1-main-role-management-workflow"
     },
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "1. Main Role Management Workflow"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "c": [
      "This workflow handles the initial form interactions and standard role updates."
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Conditional Logic Web:"
         ]
        },
        " The workflow uses a web of “Define Comparison” calls to route the execution based on the chosen action."
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Handling Arrays vs. Strings:"
         ]
        },
        " A key challenge is that adding or removing entitlements can involve a single item (output as a string) or multiple items (output as an array). Passing this directly into a JSON body can break the API call if it expects one format over the other. To resolve this, the workflow branches to handle single and multiple selections distinctly."
       ]
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "Workflow Code:"
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "br"
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "a",
       "a": {
        "class": "attachment",
        "href": "https://developer.sailpoint.com/discuss/uploads/short-url/iZ39WkvcmVRLGzGQWzKzeEWLAQd.json"
       },
       "c": [
        "RoleManagement_cleansed.json"
       ]
      },
      " (20.3 KB)"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "div",
     "a": {
      "class": "d-wrap",
      "data-wrap": "center"
     },
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "lightbox",
       "a": {
        "full": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/original/3X/f/e/feae60f6916204ef8f48f842355c0d67c245a6f8.png",
        "src": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/optimized/3X/f/e/feae60f6916204ef8f48f842355c0d67c245a6f8_2_690x442.png",
        "srcSet": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/optimized/3X/f/e/feae60f6916204ef8f48f842355c0d67c245a6f8_2_690x442.png, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/optimized/3X/f/e/feae60f6916204ef8f48f842355c0d67c245a6f8_2_1035x663.png 1.5x, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/optimized/3X/f/e/feae60f6916204ef8f48f842355c0d67c245a6f8_2_1380x884.png 2x",
        "alt": "RoleManagement20260712",
        "width": "690",
        "height": "442"
       }
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "h4",
     "a": {
      "id": "h-2-add-entitlement-workflow"
     },
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "2. Add Entitlement Workflow"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "c": [
      "Adding an entitlement is relatively straightforward using a PATCH call, but there is a specific nuance when adding multiple entitlements at once."
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Wait Time Workaround:"
         ]
        },
        " When sending multiple ADD patch requests simultaneously, they can potentially overwrite each other, causing some entitlements to be missed. Standard parallel loops do not work reliably for this scenario. To fix this, a ",
        {
         "t": "code",
         "c": [
          "waittime"
         ]
        },
        " variable (e.g., 5 seconds) is added between iterations in the serial loop to ensure each patch is processed successfully."
       ]
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "Workflow Code:"
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "br"
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "a",
       "a": {
        "class": "attachment",
        "href": "https://developer.sailpoint.com/discuss/uploads/short-url/9QMsmrYqY3YjHLTsVQHnQTz5l9K.json"
       },
       "c": [
        "AddEntitlementFromRole_cleansed.json"
       ]
      },
      " (4.7 KB)"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "div",
     "a": {
      "class": "d-wrap",
      "data-wrap": "center"
     },
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "lightbox",
       "a": {
        "full": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/original/3X/3/a/3af6e1fe9ae6a5c84079dd1d6ede43ab408ba3b5.png",
        "src": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/optimized/3X/3/a/3af6e1fe9ae6a5c84079dd1d6ede43ab408ba3b5_2_340x500.png",
        "srcSet": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/optimized/3X/3/a/3af6e1fe9ae6a5c84079dd1d6ede43ab408ba3b5_2_340x500.png, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/optimized/3X/3/a/3af6e1fe9ae6a5c84079dd1d6ede43ab408ba3b5_2_510x750.png 1.5x, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/optimized/3X/3/a/3af6e1fe9ae6a5c84079dd1d6ede43ab408ba3b5_2_680x1000.png 2x",
        "alt": "AddEntitlementFromRole20260712",
        "width": "340",
        "height": "500"
       }
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "h4",
     "a": {
      "id": "h-3-remove-entitlement-workflow"
     },
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "3. Remove Entitlement Workflow"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "c": [
      "Removing entitlements is the most complex part of this solution due to the mechanics of JSON Patch."
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Index Shifting Challenge:"
         ]
        },
        " JSON Patch only allows removals by index. When you remove one entitlement, the index shifts for all subsequent entitlements. To handle this safely, we perform only ",
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "one removal per execution"
         ]
        },
        ". We pull the role details fresh every run to ensure we are targeting the correct index."
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Dynamic Re-looping:"
         ]
        },
        " The workflow has two paths depending on if it receives a string (single item) or an array (multiple items) in the ",
        {
         "t": "code",
         "c": [
          "entitlementstoremove"
         ]
        },
        " trigger. The single path signifies the last entitlement, allowing the workflow to exit. The array path processes the first item, and then makes an HTTP call to re-trigger the workflow with the remaining array items."
       ]
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "mermaid",
     "a": {
      "value": "flowchart TD\n    Start([Workflow Trigger]) --> InputCheck{\"entitlementstoremove\\ntype?\"}\n    \n    InputCheck -- \"Array (Multiple Items)\" --> ExtractFirst[\"Extract 1st Item\"]\n    ExtractFirst --> SliceArray[\"Store Remaining Items\\nin nextlist\"]\n    SliceArray --> FindIndex[\"GET Role -> Find Index of 1st Item\"]\n    FindIndex --> RemoveEntitlement[\"PATCH: Remove Entitlement by Index\"]\n    RemoveEntitlement --> RecallWorkflow[\"POST: Re-Trigger Workflow\\nwith nextlist\"]\n    RecallWorkflow --> EndMultiple([End Current Execution])\n\n    InputCheck -- \"String (Single Item)\" --> FindIndexSingle[\"GET Role -> Find Index of Item\"]\n    FindIndexSingle --> RemoveSingle[\"PATCH: Remove Entitlement by Index\"]\n    RemoveSingle --> EndSingle([End Current Execution])\n\n    RecallWorkflow -.-> |\"New Trigger Event\\n(until all removed)\"| Start"
     }
    },
