     "a": {
      "id": "safety-and-governance-guardrails"
     },
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "Safety and Governance Guardrails"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "p",
     "c": [
      "While delegating role management empowers business owners and reduces IAM overhead, this workflow modifies roles and access related configurations. It is crucial to implement the following guardrails before deploying this solution to production:"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Ownership Validation:"
         ]
        },
        " Ensure the Role Selector Form strictly filters roles by the current user’s ID (",
        {
         "t": "code",
         "c": [
          "trigger.launchedby.id"
         ]
        },
        "). This prevents users from selecting and modifying roles they do not own."
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Approvals and Review Steps:"
         ]
        },
        " The current implementation lacks an approval schema. It is highly recommended to add an approval step within the workflow (routing modifications to the IAM team or a secondary owner for review) before the API calls are executed, particularly when adding high risk entitlements."
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Entitlement Restrictions:"
         ]
        },
        " To prevent owners from adding highly privileged or restricted entitlements to their roles, implement a filter or allowlist in the form’s entitlement selection field. Alternatively, add logic in the workflow to check for restricted entitlements and require additional approvals."
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "External Workflow Protection:"
         ]
        },
        " Ensure the external trigger workflows (Add/Remove Entitlement) are securely configured. Treat the Client ID and Secret generated for these workflows like highly sensitive passwords to ensure they cannot be triggered by unauthorized external sources."
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Audit and Rollback Considerations:"
         ]
        },
        " Log all modifications made through this form (using a webhook to a ticketing system like ServiceNow, or sending an email notification to an audit group). Because role changes can impact access for many users, maintaining a clear audit trail ensures changes can be tracked and manually rolled back if an error occurs."
       ]
      },
      "\n"
     ]
